<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 560.44, up 3.71.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 286 to 197.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.09.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,261,275 compared with 21,152,090 on Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
